About the job

Sales Engineer | Região Centro Interior




📍 Região Centro Interior

Na Daikin, criamos soluções inovadoras de climatização e controlo da qualidade do ar que transformam os espaços em ambientes mais confortáveis, saudáveis e eficientes. Mais do que tecnologia, movemo-nos pelo impacto positivo no bem-estar das pessoas e pelo compromisso com um futuro mais sustentável. Somos uma empresa certificada há 4 anos consecutivos como Great Place to Work®, reconhecimento que reflete a nossa cultura de confiança, colaboração e desenvolvimento contínuo das nossas pessoas.




Se tens experiência na área de AVAC e procuras um desafio que combine conhecimento técnico, desenvolvimento de negócio e proximidade com os clientes, esta oportunidade é para ti.




🎯 O teu papel

Reportando ao Sales Manager da Região Sul, terás como missão gerir e desenvolver uma carteira de clientes na área de AVAC, contribuindo para o crescimento sustentável do negócio através da identificação de oportunidades, apresentação de soluções técnico-comerciais e concretização dos objetivos de vendas definidos, na região centro interior de Portugal.




No teu dia-a-dia, vais:

Gerir e desenvolver uma carteira de clientes no mercado AVAC;
Identificar novas oportunidades de negócio e acompanhar projetos comerciais;
Analisar as necessidades dos clientes e propor soluções técnicas adequadas;
Elaborar e apresentar propostas técnico-comerciais;
Negociar e acompanhar processos de venda até ao respetivo fecho;
Assegurar o cumprimento dos objetivos comerciais e do budget anual definido;
Promover a gama de produtos e soluções Daikin junto de clientes e potenciais clientes;
Desenvolver relações de confiança e parceria de longo prazo com os clientes.




🔎 O que procuramos

Licenciatura ou Mestrado em Engenharia Mecânica ou área similar;
Experiência mínima de 7 anos em funções comerciais no mercado AVAC;
Forte interesse pelas áreas comercial e técnica;
Conhecimentos de obra e/ou direção de obra serão valorizados;
Excelente orientação para o cliente e para resultados;
Elevado nível de autonomia, proatividade e capacidade de organização;
Boas competências de comunicação, negociação e relacionamento interpessoal;
Disponibilidade para deslocações frequentes em território nacional;
Bons conhecimentos de Inglês (mínimo nível B1);
Conhecimentos de Microsoft Office e ferramentas informáticas na ótica do utilizador;
Residência na região centro interior será valorizada (Beira Baixa, Alto Alentejo).




🤝 O que oferecemos

Na Daikin, valorizamos as pessoas e o seu bem-estar. Por isso, oferecemos:

Seguro de Saúde
25 dias de férias
Dia de aniversário
Café e fruta gratuitos no local de trabalho
Momentos de convívio entre colegas
Parcerias com empresas de bem-estar
Oportunidades reais de desenvolvimento e progressão
Integração numa empresa multinacional, líder de mercado e orientada para a sustentabilidade




👉 Candidata-te agora e vem fazer parte da nossa equipa.

Queres saber mais sobre o que a Daikin tem para oferecer? Clica aqui: https://careers.daikin.eu/dapt/?locale=pt_PT

About the job

Responsibilities
Team Intro
The commerce industry has seen tremendous growth in recent years and has become a hotly contested space amongst leading Internet companies, and its future growth cannot be underestimated.
With millions of loyal users globally, we believe TikTok is an ideal platform to deliver a brand new and better commerce experience to our users. We are looking for passionate and talented people to join our operations team, together we can build an commerce ecosystem that is innovative, secure and intuitive for our users.

Responsibilities:
1. Define the long-term strategy, leading key initiatives, and setting the future direction of the Fashion category;
2. Responsible for the P&L of Fashion category; 
3. Provide industry knowledge and leveraging own network to ensure success of category;
4. Hire and develop a strong team;
5. Acquire and incubate Fashion brands and partners to support category growth;
6. Discover innovative collaborative models that fit into brands' short-term and long-term development plans, and invest platform resources effectively and efficiently;
7. Collaborate crossfunctionally to unlock brands' potential on the platform, drive business growth and adoption of livestream and short videos;
8. Navigate through ambiguity, adapting to frequent changes and influencing key stakeholders to drive decisions for the category;
9. Solve key challenges in business growth by strong collaboration with cross-function teams.

Qualifications
Minimum Qualifications:
1. Network within the Fashion space and strong knowledge of the Mexican Fashion industry landscape, consumer demands, digital evolution and mobile transformation;
2. Strong interpersonal skills, excellent communication and negotiation skills, logical thinking, and analytical skills;
3. Customer service orientation and experience working in a client facing capacity;
4. Strong sense of social content, practical experience in the social commerce, content marketing, influencers, and creativity in the categories;
5. Solid experience in people management, leading a diverse team;
6. Experience of owning P&L;
7. Fluent in English, good communication and collaboration skills working cross functionally in a global working environment.

Preferred Qualifications:
1. Eager to win, growth driven, business mindset, result driven;
2. Collaborative and open to changes and challenges and learn;
3. A fast learner with a good sense of judgment and original thinking;
4. Ability to thrive in ambiguity and adapt quickly to change.

About TikTok
TikTok is the leading destination for short-form mobile video. At TikTok, our mission is to inspire creativity and bring joy. TikTok's global headquarters are in Los Angeles and Singapore, and we also have offices in New York City, London, Dublin, Paris, Berlin, Dubai, Jakarta, Seoul, and Tokyo.


Why Join Us
Inspiring creativity is at the core of TikTok's mission. Our innovative product is built to help people authentically express themselves, discover and connect – and our global, diverse teams make that possible. Together, we create value for our communities, inspire creativity and bring joy - a mission we work towards every day.
We strive to do great things with great people. We lead with curiosity, humility, and a desire to make impact in a rapidly growing tech company. Every challenge is an opportunity to learn and innovate as one team. We're resilient and embrace challenges as they come. By constantly iterating and fostering an "Always Day 1" mindset, we achieve meaningful breakthroughs for ourselves, our company, and our users. When we create and grow together, the possibilities are limitless. Join us.

Diversity & Inclusion
TikTok is committed to creating an inclusive space where employees are valued for their skills, experiences, and unique perspectives. Our platform connects people from across the globe and so does our workplace. At TikTok, our mission is to inspire creativity and bring joy. To achieve that goal, we are committed to celebrating our diverse voices and to creating an environment that reflects the many communities we reach. We are passionate about this and hope you are too.


TikTok Accommodation
TikTok is committed to providing reasonable accommodations in our recruitment processes for candidates with disabilities, pregnancy, sincerely held religious beliefs or other reasons protected by applicable laws. If you need assistance or a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at https://tinyurl.com/RA-request
